<ContentLayout
  title="B2B SEO Website Audit: Pages, Search Demand and Enquiry Paths"
  description="A B2B SEO audit checks whether search visibility supports the full buying journey, from research pages to qualified enquiry paths, with evidence for technical, content and conversion findings."
